F::readRole --> IF::comments #C05621
F::status --> IF::comments #C05621

legend bottom
  Arrows point in export direction; the import reads the same arrows backwards.
  <b>Source</b> and <b>Library</b> do not exist in Metatrack: the export creates them, the import skips them.
  The processes link the chain Source → Sample → Library → Raw Data File; MARS follows it backwards from each file.
  <b>Not exported:</b> hostSubjectId (patient reference), members, storage paths, timestamps, archived custom fields.
endlegend
@enduml
